  "description_html": "Skeletal diagram of <i><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Adratiklit\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Adratiklit\">Adratiklit boulahfa</a></i> showing all referred fossil material scaled to a single individual. All scale bars=1 m.\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Key\">Key</h3></div>\n<p><b style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1.7;width:1.7em;margin-right:-1px;border:1px solid #808080;background:#FFFFFF\" title=\"#FFFFFF\"> </b>=Holotype <small style=\"font-size:85%;\">(NHMUK PV R37366)</small><br>\n<b style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1.7;width:1.7em;margin-right:-1px;border:1px solid #808080;background:#F7BBBB\" title=\"#F7BBBB\"> </b>=Referred <small style=\"font-size:85%;\">(NHMUK PV R37365)</small><br>\n<b style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1.7;width:1.7em;margin-right:-1px;border:1px solid #808080;background:#F29494\" title=\"#F29494\"> </b>=Referred <small style=\"font-size:85%;\">(NHMUK PV R37007)</small><br>\n<b style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1.7;width:1.7em;margin-right:-1px;border:1px solid #808080;background:#EA5555\" title=\"#EA5555\"> </b>=Referred <small style=\"font-size:85%;\">(NHMUK PV R37368)</small><br>\n<b style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1.7;width:1.7em;margin-right:-1px;border:1px solid #808080;background:#E00101\" title=\"#E00101\"> </b>=Referred <small style=\"font-size:85%;\">(NHMUK PV R37367)</small><br>\n<b style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1.7;width:1.7em;margin-right:-1px;border:1px solid #808080;background:#8C8C8C\" title=\"#8C8C8C\"> </b>=Unknown\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"References\">References</h3></div>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1016%2Fj.gr.2019.07.007\">\"North Africa's first stegosaur: Implications for Gondwanan thyreophoran dinosaur diversity\"</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.earscirev.2022.104196\">\"Impact of 